[E0454] Error: an implicit is one name
    ╭─[ err/471_implicit_declared/main.wip:42:2 ]
    │
 42 │     implicit val (a, b) = (1, 2)
    │     ────┬───
    │         ╰───── `implicit` before a pattern
    │
    │ Note: a call fills an implicit parameter from the binding of its name, so an implicit binds one name and nothing else
